    "prerequisites": "Level 14",
    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>CLASS UNLIVING</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 14</p>\n<p>Your transformation settles into the full stillness of undeath.</p>\n<p>You gain any of the following standard Undead immunities that you do not already possess: Bleed, Poison, Sleep, Paralysis and Stunning. You also no longer need to eat, breathe, or sleep if you did not already have those traits.</p>\n<p>Be aware, this feat does not remove your PC Death State and does not cause you to be automatically destroyed at 0 HP.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: immunity to Bleed, poison, sleep, Paralyzed and Stunned (those you already have add nothing). Your Death State is unchanged.</p>",
